    {
      "id": 1,
      "plugin": "Core",
      "model": "Notes",
      "version": "2.6.6",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "text": "TriggerFish playable development patch\n\nSETUP\nSelect MIDI and audio devices in the MIDI-CV and Audio-8 displays. For computer keyboard input, select Computer keyboard/mouse and an appropriate keyboard layout. Start with monitor volume low.\n\nVOICE A\nMIDI pitch -> Slop -> VDPO -> TriggerFish VCA -> final mixer.\n\nVOICE B\nMIDI pitch -> Slop4 -> four VCV VCOs (two unison, two one octave higher) -> VCA Mix -> TriggerFish VCA -> final mixer.\n\nAll TriggerFish module parameters use their declared defaults. Native module settings are chosen to make the patch playable. The final VCA Mix module is the master: its Mix level is -6 dB and feeds VCV Audio-8 outputs 1/2 directly."
      },
      "pos": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
